{"schemaVersion":1,"slug":"kachni-prsa-se-zelnymi-listy","title":"Kachní prsa se savojským zelím","description":"Jednopánvové kachní prso s bramborami, slaninou a savojským zelím.","demo":false,"yield":{"amount":4,"label":"porce"},"prepMinutes":10,"cookMinutes":30,"category":"Hlavní jídla","tags":["Kachna","Z jedné pánve","Zelí"],"ingredients":[{"items":[{"id":"kachni-prsa","name":"kachní prsa","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"pepr","name":"kuličky pepře","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"brambory","name":"vařené nové brambory","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":600},"unit":"g"},{"id":"slanina","name":"uzená prorostlá slanina","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":6},"unit":"ks","note":"plátky"},{"id":"zeli","name":"savojské zelí","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"cesnek","name":"stroužek česneku","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"ocet","name":"balzamikový ocet","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":15},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"olej","name":"olivový olej","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":30},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"petrzel","name":"čerstvá petržel","quantity":{"kind":"text","text":"malá hrst"}}]}],"steps":["Kůži na kachních prsech nařízněte, okořeňte pepřem a opékejte kůží dolů na nízkém plameni 15 minut. Otočte a dopečte 5 minut, pak nechte odpočinout.","Ve výpeku opečte plátky brambor. Přidejte slaninu, zelí a česnek, podlijte malým množstvím vody a poduste do změknutí.","Vmíchejte ocet, olej a petržel, nakrájenou kachnu podávejte navrch."],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/one-pan-duck-savoy-cabbage","author":"Barney Desmazery · BBC Good Food","importedAt":"2026-09-19"}],"provenance":{"kind":"facts"}}
